{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 20, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the break of dawn, thou shalt arise and make thy way to the airport, where thou shalt board a plane and embark upon thy journey to the land of the rising sun, Japan.\n\n\nUpon thy arrival in Tokyo, the capital city, thou shalt visit the Meiji Shrine, a peaceful and spiritual oasis amidst the hustle and bustle of the metropolis. Here, thou shalt pay thy respects to the deities enshrined within and take in the beauty of the surrounding gardens.\n\n\nNext, thou shalt venture to Asakusa, where the ancient and modern worlds collide. Here, thou shalt marvel at the Sensoji Temple, the oldest temple in Tokyo, and stroll down Nakamise Shopping Street, where thou shalt find souvenirs and treats to delight thy senses.\n\n\nIn the afternoon, thou shalt make thy way to the Tsukiji Fish Market, where thou shalt bear witness to the flurry of activity as fishermen and chefs haggle over the freshest catches of the day. Here, thou shalt also sample some of the delicious sushi and seafood dishes that the market has to offer.\n\n\nAs the sun begins to set, thou shalt make thy way to the Shibuya Crossing, the busiest intersection in the world. Here, thou shalt join the throngs of people crossing the street and take in the neon-lit spectacle of the cityscape.\n\n\nOn the second day of thy journey, thou shalt embark on a train ride to the ancient city of Kyoto. Upon thy arrival, thou shalt visit the Fushimi Inari Shrine, where thou shalt walk through the famous vermilion torii gates and explore the sacred mountain trails.\n\n\nNext, thou shalt visit the Kinkakuji Temple, also known as the Golden Pavilion, where thou shalt gaze upon the shimmering golden reflection of the temple in the calm waters of the pond.\n\n\nIn the afternoon, thou shalt stroll through the Arashiyama Bamboo Grove, where thou shalt be enveloped in a serene and tranquil forest of towering bamboo stalks.\n\n\nOn the final day of thy journey, thou shalt visit the Hiroshima Peace Memorial Park, where thou shalt pay thy respects to the victims of the atomic bombing and reflect upon the importance of peace and understanding in our world.\n\n\nAt last, thou shalt return to Tokyo, where thou shalt spend thy final evening in the city, taking in the sights, sounds, and flavors of this wondrous land.\n\n\nAnd so, with a heavy heart, thou shalt bid farewell to Japan, taking with thee memories and experiences that shall last a lifetime. Fare thee well, dear traveler, and may good fortune follow thee on all thy future journeys.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.308956116437912}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.021099278703331947}, {"token": "break", "logprob": -1.7590998411178589}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -3.099436753473128e-06}, {"token": "dawn", "logprob": -0.018786242231726646}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.000590865034610033}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.020684484392404556}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -0.0007656264933757484}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "arise", "logprob": -0.08786087483167648}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -2.2649508537142538e-05}, {"token": "make", "logprob": -0.06545848399400711}, {"token": "thy", "logprob": -0.20040087401866913}, {"token": "way", "logprob": -0.0004067785630468279}, {"token": "to", "logprob": -0.0002057340752799064}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -2.455681169521995e-05}, {"token": "airport", "logprob": -0.1479388177394867}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.12754672765731812}, {"token": "where", "logprob": -0.03141798451542854}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.9219790697097778}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -0.008960275910794735}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "board", "logprob": -0.009865572676062584}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -1.6569954823353328e-05}, {"token": "plane", "logprob": -1.0934520959854126}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -2.4796881675720215}, {"token": 